OL,3,GNEWSAPolice sack 19 officers and staff
OL,4,Afor misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 20 West Midlands Police officers
OL,7,Fand staff members were fired for
OL,8,Fmisconduct within the last year,
OL,9,Faccording to a report.
OL,11,FThe figures, due to be presented to
OL,12,FWest Midlands Police and Crime Panel on
OL,13,FMonday, show a total of 19 employees
OL,14,Fwere sacked following misconduct
OL,15,Fhearings and meetings held in 2025/26.
OL,17,FA further 23 employees would have been
OL,18,Fdismissed had they not already left the
OL,19,Fforce before their hearings took place,
OL,20,Fit added.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
