OL,3,GNEWSAPolice sack 19 officers and staff
OL,4,Afor misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe figures emerge after recent
OL,7,Fmisconduct allegations involving
OL,8,Fofficers from the West Midlands force,
OL,9,Fincluding one who a panel said "abused
OL,10,Fhis role for sexual purposes", and
OL,11,Fanother who inappropriately accessed
OL,12,Fpolice records more than 2,000 times.
